    - target: {fileID: 7222691419828877991, guid: cdf805fec9c199045ba01bc8b49027ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Hi assistant,\r\n\r\nCan you do me a huge favor and tell me if Gwen
        still is mad at me for forgetting to feed her dragon? She refuses to send
        replies for my scrolls. I really need her to sign off those orders or she
        will be the least of my problems. \r\n\r\nOh, and also, do you know if Rufus
        got the treats I left at Gwen\u2019s desk after the incident?\r\n\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
